item.description:
Whoever took nearly 4,000 bitcoin from the Liquid Network on Sunday, September 6,&amp;nbsp;returned 3,400 of it&amp;nbsp;the next day, Bitcoin&apos;s public record shows. About 598.5 bitcoin has not come back.

Liquid is a Bitcoin sidechain that holds real bitcoin to back a token called L-BTC. The network is still paused, so holders cannot turn that token back into bitcoin.

The 3,400 bitcoin was sent to a&amp;

